{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Seclusa!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seclusa is a blend of casual photography simulator and cozy idle game where you can play as actively or passively as you want. Each area has been handcrafted to be highly ambient and immersive, whether you're photographing the local wildlife or relaxing by the fire as the sun sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116610/extras/GIF_Photo.gif?t=1746473898\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Snap Photos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your camera ready for a variety of East African wildlife as you take on photography jobs for conservation groups. As you level up, you'll unlock more animals and locations, as well as camera upgrades that can completely change the look and feel of your photos. Keep an eye out for rare variants of each species!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gain Experience &amp; Level Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fulfill daily tasks, complete objectives, or turn on the radio and watch the day go by as nature lives on around you. Leveling up earns you credits which can be used to improve your camera, purchase amenities at the lodge, build up your card collection, and even unlock the power to change the weather and time of day on a whim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116610/extras/GIF_TimeLapse.gif?t=1746473898\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Photography Sandbox</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With fully unlocked abilities, you'll have the freedom to curate your subject and setting to your liking. Change the time of day and weather, tweak the processing to fit the mood, and call on a specific animal species to be your subject.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relax &amp; Unwind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seclusa is designed to be a stress-free, predominantly point &amp; click experience that can be enjoyed both actively and passively. Whether you're enjoying a jigsaw puzzle at the lodge, opening packs of collectible cards, or trying to catch a rare animal sighting, sit back and enjoy the immersive African soundscapes and original soundtrack. You're on safari, enjoy it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116610/extras/GIF_LodgeNight_v2.gif?t=1746473898\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2116610?t=1746473898","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116610/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746473898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116610/c8d04c38148025ddace24164f2ce081dc54400db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746473898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116610/c8d04c38148025ddace24164f2ce081dc54400db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746473898","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3240900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Seclusa!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seclusa is a blend of casual photography simulator and cozy idle game where you can play as actively or passively as you want. Each area has been handcrafted to be highly ambient and immersive, whether you're photographing the local wildlife or relaxing by the fire as the sun sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116610/extras